   "en": "ADM2304, Applications of Statistical Methods in Business (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is ADM2704. Topics: Topics include the estimation (using confidence intervals) and hypothesis testing (including non-parametric methods); correlation and the simple linear regression model (with extensions to multiple regression); and chi-square tests on qualitative data. Prerequisite: ADM2303."
