   "en": "BCH2333, Introduction to Biochemistry (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is BCH2733. Topics: The chemistry and biological properties of amino acids, proteins, nucleic acids, lipids, carbohydrates, and vitamins. The course includes laboratory and tutorial sessions. Prerequisite: CHM2120."
