   "en": "BIO2110, Environmental Physiology (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is BIO2510. Topics: How representative individual healthy organisms respond to various natural or anthropogenic physical environmental parameters such as temperature, water, pH, electromagnetic radiation including UV, gases, pressure and heavy metals. Prerequisite: BIO1131."
