   "en": "CHG2314, Heat Transfer Operations (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is CHG2714. Topics: Steady-state heat conduction in solids with and without extended surfaces. Natural and forced convective heat transfer. Transient heat conduction. Heat exchangers. Boiling heat transfer. Condensation. Evaporation. Prerequisites: CHG2312, MAT2384."
