   "en": "CHG2317, Introduction to Chemical Process Analysis and Design (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is CHG2717. Topics: Process analysis and design using mass and energy balances. Thermodynamic data and relationships. Simultaneous mass and energy balances on reactive and non-reactive systems. Mixing and solutions. Prerequisite: CHG1125."
