   "en": "CHM2120, Organic Chemistry II (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is CHM2520. Topics: This course builds on the fundamental concepts introduced in its prerequisite, emphasizing the relationship between structural information and the reactivity of organic molecules, reaction mechanisms, multi-step synthesis and stereochemistry. Prerequisite: CHM1321."
