   "en": "CHM2311, Introduction to Structure and Bonding (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is CHM2711. Topics: Applications of quantum theory: atomic structure, bonding in molecules, molecular orbital theory, metallic bond, molecular symmetry. Structure and energetics of solids. Prerequisites: (MAT1320 or MAT1321 or MAT1327 or MAT1330), (CHM1301 or CHM1311)."
