   "en": "CHM2354, Analytical Chemistry (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is CHM2754. Topics: An introduction to fundamental principles of analytical chemistry, including analytical data, theory of acid-base and redox titrations, and separation schemes. Buffer solutions and precipitation equilibria. Prerequisites: CHM1301 or CHM1311."
