   "en": "CHM2132, Physical Chemistry for the Life Sciences (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is CHM2532. Topics: A course intended primarily for Biology and Biochemistry students. Laws of chemical thermodynamics and their application in bioenergetics. Properties of solutions. Prerequisites: (CHM1301 or CHM1311), (MAT1322 or MAT1332), (PHY1121 or PHY1321 or PHY1331)."
