   "en": "CHM2330, Physical Chemistry: Introduction to the Molecular Properties of Matter (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is CHM2730. Topics: Introduction to the molecular interpretation of physico-chemical phenomena. Introduction to quantum mechanics, statistical mechanics andspectroscopy (vibrational, rotational, nmr). Kinetic theory of gases. Prerequisites: (CHM1301 or CHM1311), (MAT1322 or MAT1332), (PHY1121 or PHY1321 or PHY1122 or PHY1331)."
