   "en": "CSI2101, Discrete Structures (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is CSI2501. Topics: Discrete structures as they apply to computer science, algorithm analysis and design. Predicate logic. Review of proof techniques; application of induction to computing problems. Prerequisite: MAT1348."
