   "en": "CSI2372, Advanced Programming Concepts With C++ (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is CSI2772. Topics: Differences between C++ and Java programming. C++ data types. Pointers and memory management. Object oriented programming in C++. File and stream I/O. Pre-processor macros. Templates and the Standard Template Library. Prerequisites: ITI1121, ITI1100."
