   "en": "MAT2335, Introduction to Numerical Methods (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is MAT2735. Topics: Introduction to computing environments. Floating point errors. Numerical solution of nonlinear equations (bisection, fixed point, Newton, secant, gradient descent), linear and nonlinear systems. Prerequisites: ITI1120, MAT1322, MAT1341."
