   "en": "POL2101, Introduction to Canadian Politics (3 units), is taught in English; the French version is POL2501. Topics: Foundations of the Canadian political space. Constitution, parliamentary government, federalism. Political parties and elections. Overview of political forces (classes, groups, movements). (CAN). Prerequisites: POL1101 or POL1102 or 15 university course units."
